~ scene38flashback1
Carmilla waits at the school entrance for Margaret to walk home together, but she does not show up after 2 hours.
Carmilla's Mother: Carmilla! Where have thou been?
Carmilla's Father: Where is dear Peggy?
Carmilla: I hast no idea.. She did not show up after schooling!
Carmilla's Mother: Oh dear.. We must report it to the police!
Carmilla's Father: My dear, we must not. I am afraid it is out of our hands.
Carmilla: But Father! It is Margaret! We must not leave her behind!
Carmilla's Father: I am sorry, young Carmilla. Come. We must go back home.
=> END

~ scene38flashback2
???: Excuse me, miss?
Carmilla: Yes? Doth need help?
???: My husband and I wanted to bid thou some questions.
Carmilla: If you must.
???: We are asking around about our daughter. She has been gone for 10 years now. We pray this is the school she went to. 
Carmilla: What is her name?
???: Margaret. Margaret Dubois.
Carmilla is extremely shocked to hear Margaret's name. 
Carmilla: She hath been living with us. For the past 10 years...
Margarets's Mother: Preposterous! Thou took our only daughter?! Police! Police! This woman hath stolen our daughter!
Carmilla: No.. you do not understand! I love her!
The police arrive.
Carmilla: I am sorry! Please do not have thy taken away!
Magaret's Father: Arrest this young lady! She hath robbed us from our daughter!!
