~ scene39carmillaroom1
Carmilla breaks down the door.
Carmilla: You have made a grave mistake Lauren!
Lauren: Wait! I know who the woman in the painting is.
Carmilla: .....Whom?
Lauren: Margaret. My 3rd great grandmother. Her last name was Dubois. And you loved her..
Carmilla: ..How doth you know?
Lauren: I saw her memories. Just like you did when you bit me, correct?
Carmilla: What a smart one you are.
Lauren: My grandmother, Margaret- she knew about you being a vampire didn't she. Why didn't she run away earlier?
Carmilla: Daisy was in love with [shake]me![/shake] She ran away from [shake]mine love![/shake] To another country!! Why doth she do this to me?!
Lauren: Carmilla, I am sorry for what happened in the past. I am not Margaret, even though you may think I am. 
Carmilla: Thou shall never be my Margaret!
Lauren: Then what do you want from me?
Carmilla: For thou to stay here with mine for eternity. The way it should have been with Daisy and I. Our love can flourish and match what Daisy and I had, rekindling our love from the past!
Lauren: You can't keep me here forever! Even though you resent my grandmother for leaving, that doesn't mean you have to take it out on me!
Carmilla: ...I will give thine one more chance to please me. It would be in thy best interest to stay.
